    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28098" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρπον</span></b> , τό, in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>evening meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.439
			</span></i>; taken at sunset, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.208
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.429
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστα, δεῖπνα, δόρπα θ᾽ αἱρεῖσθαι
					τρίτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					182.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.20
			</span></i>.—In later 
				Ep.
			, generally, <i>meal, food,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				511
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
