			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρποιο ποτοῦ θ᾽ ἅλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					406
				</span></i>
			.</div>
